:expect-pins 4
# Fresh-process temporal case TA-33.

# The first predecessor manifest is independently witnessed.
? complete(TA_Ambiguous_Previous_A, ManifestScope).
# => TRUE

# The competing predecessor manifest is independently witnessed too.
? complete(TA_Ambiguous_Previous_B, ManifestScope).
# => TRUE

# The predecessor epoch receives the typed manifest ambiguity.
? collide(TA_Ambiguous_Previous, ManifestBinding).
# => TRUE

# Transition acceptance cannot select one convenient predecessor manifest.
? succeed(TA_Ambiguous_Current, Transition).
# => FALSE
